{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar \u201cpreparation area,\u201d surrounded by strangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that moment, the system\u2019s voice rings in your ears\u2014\u201cNew mission, commencing immediately.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission after mission, life and death hang in the balance. Some return safely, while others remain lost at the end of the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by accumulating points can you reclaim your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure with no retreat. All you can do is keep moving forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 80,000-word mid-length story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative\u2014A no-choice visual novel that delivers a tightly woven and gripping narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied mission settings, From mystery to horror, and into the realm of the bizarre, the atmosphere constantly shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional storytelling focused on bonds, survival, and character growth</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Witness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861190/df635d9b7302498889d406c9756e66ba98c21742.jpg"},{"name":"Unknown Area","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861190/9940ff8c1426869c258078dd97c4abb6ae04ae3b.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861190/98ba55562b00ae771d4abefc4b4bd85f0468afcd.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861190/d6884b51dff1bd1bd52a58d6e669ed6cb2fe73d2.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861190/ecb